Our proposed solution is designed to improve the efficiency of the City's administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users. The artificial intelligence solution will provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from the agents' work environment, capable of accompanying them in their administrative activities. This tool will assist with the search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulations, help with drafting letters or answers to users, accompany instruction of files, and suggest actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process.

