In conclusion, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. believes that our proposed solution meets the City of Belval's requirements for an artificial intelligence solution to assist its agents. We are confident that our expertise in digital transformation, AI solutions, and public sector IT, combined with our commitment to data protection, sovereignty, and sustainability, make us an ideal partner for this project.
